          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT UNDER ARTICLE 1723 OF THE CIVIL CODE OF THE PHILIPPINES, THE ENGINEER OR ARCHITECT WHO DREW UP THE PLANS AND SPECIFICATIONS FOR A BUILDINGS/STRUCTURE IS LIABLE FOR DAMAGES IF WITHIN FIFTEEN (15) YEARS FROM THE COMPLETION OF BUILDING/STRUCTURE, THE SAME SHOULD COLLAPSE DUE TO DEFECT IN THE PLANS OR SPECIFICATIONS OF DEFECTS IN THE GROUND, THE ENGINEER OR ARCHITECT WHO SUPERVISES THE CONSTRUCTION SHALL BE SOLIDARILY LIABLE WITH THE CONTRACTOR SHOULD THE EDIFICE COLLAPSE DUE TO DEFECT IN THE CONSTRUCTION OR THE USE OF INFERIOR MATERIALS.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text50>
        <Text51 Ref="55" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,8.1,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>f6d081b5e85e484c82e47df0b1070454</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text51</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>2)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text51>
        <Text52 Ref="56" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,8.1,7.4,0.4</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>0d87e21015e5451ab3fc3bd0ef9f05fa</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text52</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THIS PERMIT SHALL BE ACCOMPANIED BY THE VARIOUS APPLICABLE ANCILLARY AND ACCESSORY PERMITS, PLANS AND SPECIFICATIONS SIGNED AND SEALED BY THE CORRESPONDING DESIGN PROFESSIONALS WHO SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR THE COMPREHENSIVE AND CORRECTNESS OF THE PLANS IN COMPLIANCE TO THE CODE AND ITS IRR AND TO ALL APPLICABLE REFERRAL CODES AND PROFESSIONAL REGULATORY LAWS.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text52>
        <Text53 Ref="57" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,8.5,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>f9a7147e23b147daaacd7510130b5e53</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text53</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>3)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text53>
        <Text54 Ref="58" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,8.5,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>0e779a2f32c24350af7da64463423290</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text54</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT THE PROPOSED CONSTRUCTION/ERECTION/ADDITIONAL/ALTERATION/RENOVATION/CONVERSION/REPAIR/MOVING/DEMOTION, ETC. SHALL BE IN CONFORMITY WITH THE PROVISIONS OF THE NATIONAL BUILDING CODE AND ITS IRR.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text54>
        <Text55 Ref="59" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,8.8,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>aa9f524544064d3790fcab571337699f</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text55</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>A.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text55>
        <Text56 Ref="60" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,8.8,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>2bfed6ce1a674db8ae2da2b5bbce21fe</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text56</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT PRIOR TO COMMENCEMENT OF THE PROPOSED PROJECTS AND CONSTRUCTION AN ACTUAL RELOCATION SURVEY SHALL BE CONDUCTED BY A DULY LICENSED GEODETIC ENGINEER.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text56>
        <Text57 Ref="61" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,9,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>b618d49c913c407caee713374ef0b68e</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text57</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>B.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text57>
        <Text58 Ref="62" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,9,7.1,0.4</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>afde91e6fd434b2abe913d42b3219acd</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text58</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT BEFORE COMMENCING THE EXCAVATION THE PERSON MAKING OR CAUSING THE EXCAVATION TO BE MADE SHALL NOTIFY IN WRITING THE OWNER OF ADJOINING PROPERTY NOT LESS THAN TEN(10) DAYS BEFORE SUCH EXCAVATION IS TO BE MADE AND SHOW HOW THE ADJOINING PROPERTY SHOULD BE PROTECTED.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text58>
        <Text59 Ref="63" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,9.4,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>26f0525f575e4a2ebaec95b9b95876e9</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text59</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>C.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text59>
        <Text60 Ref="64" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,9.4,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>7476f2c3af83439da248994f6e1d3b8b</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text60</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT NO PERSON SHALL USE OR OCCUPY A STREET, ALLEY OR PUBLIC SIDEWALK FOR THE PERFORMANCE OF WORK COVERED BY A BUILDING PERMIT.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text60>
        <Text61 Ref="65" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,9.6,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>d67d4f3fd4974cc184c8f92eb2e7380f</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text61</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>D.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text61>
        <Text62 Ref="66" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,9.6,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>86ca25556ec84d8eb7d552bf42808b1a</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text62</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT NO PERSON SHALL PERFORM ANY WORK ON ANY BUILDING OR STRUCTURE ADJACENT TO A PUBLIC WAY IN GENERAL USE FOR PEDESTRIAN TRAVEL, UNLESS THE PEDESTRIANS ARE PROTECTED.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text62>
        <Text63 Ref="67" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,9.8,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>a3e91772b79d46218dda61f428c559ab</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text63</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>E.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text63>
        <Text64 Ref="68" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,9.8,7.1,0.5</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>265e2c2f14584f88933307c4dc9a7946</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text64</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT THE SUPERVISING ARCHITECT/CIVIL ENGINEER SHALL KEEP AT THE JOBSITE AT ALL TIMES A LOGBOOK OF DAILY CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES WHEREIN THE ACTUAL DAILY PROGRESS OF CONSTRUCTION INCLUDING TESTS CONDUCTED, WEATHER CONDITION AND OTHER PERTINENT DATA ARE TO BE RECORDED, SAME SHALL BE MADE AVAILABLE FOR SECURITY AND COMMENTS BY THE OBO REPRESENTATIVE DURING THE CONDUCT OF HIS/HER INSPECTION PURSUANT TO SECTION 207 OF THE NATIONAL BUILDING CODE.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text64>
        <Text65 Ref="69" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,10.3,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>a4ae4568503848a4b973673b0a6d3afd</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text65</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>F.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text65>
        <Text66 Ref="70" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,10.3,7.1,0.5</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>335c5bc705244bbd8740dade7d06ad3e</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text66</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT UPON COMPLETION OF THE CONSTRUCTION, THE SAID LICENSED SUPERVISING ARCHITECT/CIVIL ENGINEER SHALL SUBMIT TO THE BUILDING OFFICIAL DULY SIGNED AND SEALED LOGBOOK, AS-BUILT PLANS AND OTHER DOCUMENTS AND SHALL ALSO PREPARE AND SUBMIT A CERTIFICATE OF COMPLETION OF THE PROJECT STATING THAT THE CONSTRUCTION OF THE BUILDING/STRUCTURE CONFORM TO THE PROVISION OF THE CODE, ITS IRR AS WELL AS THE PLANS AND SPECIFICATIONS.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text66>
        <Text67 Ref="71" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,10.8,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>ec606c77c80d4d9bb2585ee627bc42d7</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text67</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>G.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text67>
        <Text68 Ref="72" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.6,10.8,7.1,0.6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>9a665c3e326a425ba30d516dc81866f0</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text68</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>ALL SUCH CHANGES, MODIFICATIONS AND ALTERATIONS SHALL LIKEWISE BE SUBMITTED TO THE BUILDING OFFICIAL AND THE SUBSEQUENT AMENDATORY PERMIT THEREFORE ISSUED BEFORE ANY WORK ON SAID CHANGES, MODIFICATIONS AND ALTERATIONS SHALL BE STARTED. THE AS-BUILT PLANS AND SPECIFICATIONS OF MAYBE JUST AN ORDERLY AND COMPREHENSIVE COMPILATION OF ALL DOCUMENTS WHICH INCLUDE THE ORIGINALLY SUBMITTED PLANS AND SPECIFICATIONS OF ALL AMENDMENTS THERETO AS ACTUALLY BUILT OR THEY MAY BE AN ENTIRELY NEW SET OF PLANS AND SPECIFICATIONS ACCURATELY DESCRIBING AND/OR REFLECTING THEREIN THE BUILDING AS ACTUALLY BUILT.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text68>
        <Text142 Ref="73" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,11.4,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>d4d7abf640ff4755ace5e75b39784721</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text142</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>4)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text142>
        <Text147 Ref="74" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,11.4,7.4,0.3</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>6852afaadd3e43069a1b555139c7d496</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text147</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT NO BUILDING/STRUCTURE SHALL BE USED UNTIL THE BUILDING OFFICIAL HAS ISSUED A CERTIFICATE OF OCCUPANCY THEREFORE AS PROVIDED IN THE CODE. HOWEVER A PARTAIL CERTIFICATE OF OCCUPANCY MAY BE ISSUED FOR USE/OCCUPANCY OF A PORTION(S) OF A BULDING/STRUCTURE PRIOR TO THE COMPLETION OF THE ENTIRE BUILDING/STRUCTURE</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text147>
        <Text148 Ref="75" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,11.7,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>96f48cc9465a45f988c83997ea926845</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text148</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>5)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text148>
        <Text149 Ref="76" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,11.7,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>b8c93e65612f447b89f4b6f8ac9769ad</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text149</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THAT THIS PERMIT SHALL BOT SERVE AS AN EXEMPTION FROM SECURING WRITTEN CLEARANCES FROM VARIOUS GOVERNMENT AUTHORITIES EXERCISING REGULATORY FUNCTION AFFECTING BUILDING/STRUCTURES.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text149>
        <Text150 Ref="77" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,11.9,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>a0e892ddbd754fc483ad05f0021bcb23</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text150</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>6)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text150>
        <Text151 Ref="78" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,11.9,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>2e2163a794c746158b1a34515449a311</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text151</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>WHEN THE CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERTAKEN BY CONTRACT, THE WORK SHALL BE DONE BY A DULY LICENSED AND REGISTERED CONTRACTOR PURSUANT TO THE PRIVISIONS OF THE CONTRACTOR'S LICENSE LAW (RA4566)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text151>
        <Text152 Ref="79" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,12.1,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>37448ab599c5405990f3075632d0b45f</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text152</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>7)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text152>
        <Text153 Ref="80" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,12.1,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>b09fbcc48d40468f9ede973c99b16605</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text153</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>THE OWNER/PERMITTEE SHALL SUBMIT A DULY ACCOMPLISHED PRESCRIBED 'NOTICE OF CONSTRUCTION' TO THE OFFICE OG THE BUILDING OFFICIAL PRIOR TO ANY CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITY.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text153>
        <Text154 Ref="81" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,12.3,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>733ba8db42c04b33bae2b525af7e2696</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text154</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>8)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text154>
        <Text155 Ref="82" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,12.3,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
